# Kraven's Last Hunt, chapter I: "Mill five cards. When you do, this Saga deals damage equal to the greatest power among creature cards in
# your graveyard to target creature." Bot2 has discarded an Alpine Grizzly (power 4), which is not in Bot1's graveyard and so does not
# count. Bot1's Giant Spider (2/4) is the only creature; the five milled cards are a Hill Giant (3), a Grizzly Bears (2) and three Forests,
# so the Saga deals exactly 3: the Spider survives with 3 damage (4 damage, the greatest power of either graveyard, or 5, the two creature
# cards' powers added, would destroy it; 2 would mark 2).

